  "contentHtml": "\n \n <div><div><div><div><div><div><div><!--IMG1--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/02931660.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s02931660.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG1--><br></div>Бүх зүйлс 2006 оны 1 сард эхэлсэн юм. Нью-йоркын нэгэн алдартай сэтгэл зүйч дээр нэгэн бүсгүй ирээд зүүдэндээ их олон юм хардаг тухай хэлжээ. Яг юу харсан гэхээр зурган дээрх залууг цаасан дээр зураад зүүдэнд нь амьдрал руу нь шууд ороод зөвлөгөө өгдөг гэв. Бүсгүй тэр залуутай амьдралдаа хэзээ ч уулзаж байгаагүйгээ сайн мэднэ. Сэтгэл зүйч эмчийн ширээн дээр байгаа тэрхүү зургийг харсан нэгэн хүн мөн л адил амьдрал дээр уулзаагүй ч зүүдэндээ уулзсан гэж хэлжээ. Энэ явдал олон давтагдаж эхэллээ харин зургийг интернэтэд тавихад бас л зүүдэндээ уулздаг гэсэн хүмүүс маш их олширчээ. Зүүдэндээ уулзсан гэх хүмүүс хэлэхдээ \"Хэрвээ чи түүнд таалагдахгүй бол тэр чамайг шуудхан алж чадна\" гэдэг байна. <br></div></div></div></div></div></div>Энэхүү зүйл нь үнэн бодит бөгөөд хэн нэгний санаанаасаа зохиосон зүйлс биш гэдгийг дурьдах хэрэгтэй байх. Энэхүү хүний тухай илүү их мэдээлэлийг www.thisman.org сайтаас уншиж болно. <br><div><br><!--IMG6--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/16844045.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s16844045.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG6--><br><!--IMG7--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/82288491.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s82288491.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG7--><br><!--IMG2--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/71376839.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s71376839.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG2--><br><!--IMG3--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/37269339.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s37269339.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/57299684.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s57299684.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--><br><!--IMG5--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/46045657.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s46045657.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG5--><br><!--IMG8--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/29350711.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s29350711.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG8--><br><!--IMG9--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/88820586.png\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s88820586.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG9--><br><!--IMG10--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/48064004.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s48064004.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG10--><br><!--IMG11--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/39768295.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s39768295.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG11--><br><!--IMG13--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/84631447.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s84631447.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG13--><br><!--IMG14--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/54287403.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130615214146im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/42/s54287403.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG14--><br><br><br></div>\n \n \n \n \n \n ",
